# ============================================================
#  LILY MD — SINGLE-FILE SESSION SETUP (session.card)
# ============================================================
#
#  How to set up your WhatsApp session:
#  1. Pair your WhatsApp through the website:
#     - Open https://lilymd.onrender.com (or your local web dashboard)
#     - Pair via Phone Code or QR Code.
#  2. You will receive a "session.card" in your WhatsApp chat.
#  3. Open this file (session.card), copy that card code,
#     and replace the demo placeholder line below.
#  4. Save this file and start the bot: npm start
#     (The bot connects automatically without asking for a new pairing code or QR!)
#
#  Format: LilyMD~XXXXXXXXXXXXXXX (or full base64 session archive)
# ============================================================
LilyMD~DEMO_SESSION_CARD_PLACEHOLDER
